Playground (not an upstream pull request): the canvas module's outline helpers, for live editing's presence marks.

The others' marks over the canvas (live/presence.rs, a child module of the canvas, see live.diff) outline objects
with the helpers the canvas outlines its own selection with, and name them through `super::`. Where upstream keeps
them in canvas.rs this holds as is; where it has moved them to canvas/outline.rs, this brings them into the canvas
module's namespace (kurbo_flatten, private there, made visible to it).

